# Measured on the MI300X/Qwen3-8B capture, high-sum_kv quartile vs low-sum_kv
# quartile of a SINGLE cell:
#
#     cell (tt=1,  conc=2)   5021us -> 5666us   1.13x
#     cell (tt=16, conc=17)  6494us -> 7339us   1.13x
#     cell (tt=8,  conc=7)   6344us -> 7989us   1.26x
#     cell (tt=64, conc=62)  8233us -> 11925us  1.45x
#
# i.e. a decode step over 4k-token contexts was modelled identically to one over
# 200-token contexts, and the error grew exactly where emulation is most used:
# high concurrency, deep context, the KV-cache cliff.
